  {
    "id": "20261112-215112",
    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Taobao: Telefon g‘ilofi modelingizga mosmi?",
    "text": "📱 <b>TAOBAO: G‘ILOF TELEFONINGIZGA MOSMI?</b>\n\nO‘xshash nomli telefon modellari bor. G‘ilof tanlashdan oldin model nomini to‘liq solishtiring.\n\n<b>Immensus Post tavsiyasi:</b>\n1️⃣ Telefoningiz sozlamalarini oching.\n2️⃣ Telefon haqidagi ma’lumotlardan model nomini toping.\n3️⃣ Taobao’dagi g‘ilof variantlari bilan nomni to‘liq solishtiring.\n4️⃣ Mos variantni tanlaganingizni to‘lovdan oldin qayta tekshiring.\n\nMasalan, model nomida “Pro” bo‘lsa, sotuvchi variantida ham “Pro” borligini tekshiring.\n\nG‘ilof tanlash: <a href=\"https://www.zgjssw.gov.cn/yaowen/202204/t20220424_7516172.shtml\">Manba</a>\nOnlayn xaridni qaytarish: <a href=\"https://www.samr.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/fgs/art/2023/art_26ca8fe29e184edd899fa0a7a060d935.html\">Manba</a>\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBXWr2NVqQ03hacIDidCkgGJIBCzITAAIPFWsbT4ewV0f2MyuhB4X5AQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261112-215112/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Taobao: Telefon g‘ilofi modelingizga mosmi?",
      "angle": "Tekshiruv ro‘yxatida telefon sozlamasidagi model nomini topish va sotuvchining variantlari bilan to‘liq solishtirishni ko‘rsating. O‘xshash nomli modellarga e’tibor qarating.",
      "why_now": "G‘ilof kundalik xarid, lekin telefon modelini adashtirish oson.",
      "research": "2026-yil 12-noyabr holatiga ko‘ra, quyidagi mavzular Xitoy ichki bozoridagi xarid bo‘yicha rasmiy tavsiyalar bilan solishtirildi. Platformalar sarlavhada xarid misoli sifatida olingan; tasdiqlanmagan ilova funksiyalariga tayanilmadi.\n\n1. **Taobao: Sharfni mashinada yuvish mumkinmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Xariddan oldin tavsifdan yuvish ko‘rsatmasini izlash; topilmasa sotuvchidan yorliq rasmini so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda sharf va boshqa issiq kiyimlar kerak bo‘lishi mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjgj.sh.gov.cn](https://scjgj.sh.gov.cn/1072/20220720/2c984ad68215fb7201821946906f09db.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Tmall: Termosning ichki qismi nimadan yasalganini qayerdan bilish mumkin?**\n   - **Burchak:** Tavsifda ichki qism materiali aniq yozilganini tekshirish; faqat «sifatli metall» degan umumiy ta’rif bilan cheklanmaslik.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Salqin kunlarda issiq ichimlik olib yurish uchun qulay xarid mavzusi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjgj.sh.gov.cn](https://scjgj.sh.gov.cn/923/20260918/2c984a72a08215f201a0b2aede78023f.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Pinduoduo: Uy shippagining tagini nega ko‘rish kerak?**\n   - **Burchak:** Mahsulot rasmlaridan tag qismi va uning naqshini izlash; rasm bo‘lmasa sotuvchidan so‘rash. Naqshning o‘zi sirpanmaslikni kafolatlamasligini aytish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Uyda kiyiladigan shippak kundalik ehtiyoj; ayniqsa nam pol uchun tanlovga e’tibor kerak.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjg.ln.gov.cn](https://scjg.ln.gov.cn/scjdglj/fw/wyk/tbtg/cpzlaqjg/2024103011102921717/index.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Taobao: Telefon g‘ilofi aynan sizning modelingizga mosmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Telefon sozlamasidan model nomini tekshirish va uni sotuvchidagi tanlov bilan to‘liq solishtirish; o‘xshash nomlarga alohida e’tibor berish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** G‘ilof kichik va kundalik xarid, ammo modelni adashtirish oson.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 10/10. ([zgjssw.gov.cn](https://www.zgjssw.gov.cn/yaowen/202204/t20220424_7516172.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Tmall: Zaryad kabelining ikki uchi mos keladimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Bir uchini telefoningiz, ikkinchisini zaryadlagichingizdagi teshik bilan solishtirish; mahsulot tavsifida ikkala uchini tekshirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Kabel tez-tez kerak bo‘ladigan kichik buyum; o‘xshash ko‘ringan variantlar orasidan mosini tanlash muhim.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([std.samr.gov.cn](https://std.samr.gov.cn/dcpspTools/gbPlan/download?path=%2Fzxd%2F2019102268%2F20_%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E8%B5%B7%E8%8D%89%2F20_WD_2019102268_%E5%A4%9A%E5%AA%92%E4%BD%93%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E5%85%85%E7%94%B5%E7%BA%BF%E3%80%81%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BA%BF%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83.pdf&utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Tmall: Sovg‘a uchun kremning yaroqlilik muddatini qanday tekshirish mumkin?**\n   - **Burchak:** Mahsulot sahifasidan muddat ma’lumotini izlash; aniq bo‘lmasa sotuvchidan yuboriladigan mahsulot yorlig‘i rasmini so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Aksiya davridan keyin ham sovg‘a yoki kundalik parvarish mahsulotini shoshilmay tanlash foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([gov.cn](https://www.gov.cn/gbgl/bbb734277fe64ea99ef1547669063192/files/05886a5c1b6a4647a159adf25ed38bdd.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n7. **Taobao: Qo‘lqop bilan telefon ekranidan foydalansa bo‘ladimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Tavsifdan sensorli ekranga moslik haqidagi ma’lumotni izlash; noaniq bo‘lsa sotuvchidan qaysi barmoqlar bilan ishlashini so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda qo‘lqopni yechmasdan telefondan foydalanish qulay bo‘lishi mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([songjiang.gov.cn](https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/xwzx/001004/001004002/20261110/ab2d00e7-c049-4942-9299-2beca772c6b3.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n8. **Taobao: Kiyimni qaytarish ehtimoli bo‘lsa, yorlig‘ini darhol kesish kerakmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Kiyimni avval ehtiyotkorlik bilan ko‘rib chiqish, mosligini tekshirish va qaytarish shartlarini o‘qimaguncha yorliqni saqlash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** 11-noyabr aksiyasida olingan buyumlarni tekshirish davri",
